@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 850px;">
    <div class="card-tech p-4 p-md-5">
        <h1 class="mb-4" style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 2.2rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Effective Date: September 2026</p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">1. Data We Collect</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            When you register an entry in the TECH Prize Draw, we collect your Full Name, Bangladeshi Mobile Number, Email Address, and Mobile Financial Service Transaction ID (TrxID).
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">2. Purpose of Collection</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Your personal information is used exclusively to:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <li>Verify your payment transaction with official MFS records.</li>
            <li>Issue and deliver your official sequential ticket voucher.</li>
            <li>Contact you in the event your ticket number is drawn as a winner.</li>
            <li>Maintain an audited security and anti-fraud register.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">3. Public Transparency vs Privacy Protection</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Public ticket verification endpoints and winner announcements deliberately mask your personal information (e.g. <code>J*** D**</code> and <code>017******78</code>). We never publish your private transaction ID or full contact information publicly.
        </p>

        <h4 class="text-white mt-4">4. Data Security</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
            Data is stored in encrypted relational databases using industry standard access controls, salted password hashing for administrative access, and HTTPS TLS encryption.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
